'''Arachne's Burrow''' is a sub-location of the {{Zone|Spider's Den}}.

{{ZoneText|Home of &4Arachne&f.|Tread carefully.}}

== Features ==
'''Arachne's Burrow''' features many attractions.

=== Weak Wall ===
{{Main|Weak Wall}}
There are [[Weak Wall|weak walls]] situated at {{Coords|-316|96|-193}} and {{Coords|-233|71|-317}}. They function similarly to other [[Weak Wall|weak walls]], where the player must place a {{Item|Superboom TNT}} or {{Item|InfiniBoom™ TNT}} adjacent to the wall to break it. After doing so, the player can enter '''Arachne's Burrow'''.

=== Arachne's Keeper ===
{{Main|Arachne's Keeper}}
{{MobSprite|Arachne's Keeper}} is a unique mob that spawns in one of {{Green|9}} spots in '''Arachne's Burrow'''. An {{MobSprite|Arachne's Keeper}} will spawn in one of the spots at random a few seconds after the previous one has been killed. It violently attacks the player but drops {{Item|Arachne's Calling}} and a variety of loot.

=== Spider Mound ===
{{For|the massive structure on top of the [[Spider's Den]]|Spider Mound}}
The Spider Mound is a small structure located in the tunnels of '''Arachne's Burrow'''. There is a hole at the top, with a ladder leading down to a small underground room. A {{Item|Fairy Soul}} can be found here, as well as sanctuary from [[Spider (disambiguation)|Spiders]], as they cannot enter the room.

